<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1443375157"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:21.827"><div begin="16.931" end="32.296" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="16.931" end="22.644" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.931" end="17.254">不</span><span begin="17.254" end="17.648">能</span><span begin="17.648" end="17.998">回</span><span begin="17.998" end="18.634">头</span> <span begin="19.050" end="19.371">多</span><span begin="19.371" end="20.011">年前</span><span begin="20.011" end="20.347">早</span><span begin="20.347" end="21.044">明言</span><span begin="21.044" end="21.407">不</span><span begin="21.407" end="21.687">能</span><span begin="21.687" end="22.055">回</span><span begin="22.055" end="22.644">头</span></p><p begin="23.075" end="26.809" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.075" end="23.728">可恨</span><span begin="23.728" end="24.055">在</span><span begin="24.055" end="24.793">是我</span><span begin="24.793" end="25.102">这</span><span begin="25.102" end="25.395">一</span><span begin="25.395" end="25.734">头</span><span begin="25.734" end="26.115">蛮</span><span begin="26.115" end="26.809">牛</span></p><p begin="27.130" end="32.296" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.130" end="27.535">几</span><span begin="27.535" end="27.772">年</span><span begin="27.772" end="28.097">来</span><span begin="28.097" end="28.796">无法</span><span begin="28.796" end="29.143">侍</span><span begin="29.143" end="29.679">候</span> <span begin="29.839" end="30.902">才和我</span><span begin="30.902" end="31.218">分</span><span begin="31.218" end="32.296">手</span></p></div><div begin="33.150" end="50.713" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="33.150" end="37.002" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.150" end="33.843">成婚</span><span begin="33.843" end="34.187">之</span><span begin="34.187" end="34.616">前</span><span begin="34.616" end="35.181">一刻</span><span begin="35.181" end="35.539">才</span><span begin="35.539" end="36.214">赶</span><span begin="36.214" end="37.002">到</span></p><p b